      "problem": "Find $x$, if $4a+6x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}24 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
